  "titulo": "The janitor who died with $8 million",
  "descripcion": "Ronald Read pumped gas and cleaned floors his whole life, then left $8 million. No big salary, no hot tips, no tech stocks: dividends, reinvested, for sixty years. And the part nobody says.",
